hpc:OpenAPIResponse a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ hpc:Response ] ;
    rdfs:comment "OpenAPI responses for v0.0.42" .

hpc:OpenAPIInstancesResponse a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ hpc:OpenAPIResponse ] ;
    rdfs:comment "OpenAPI response for instances in v0.0.42" .

hpc:OpenAPIJobsResponse a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ hpc:OpenAPIResponse ] ;
    rdfs:comment "OpenAPI response for jobs in v0.0.42" .

# Instance response properties
hpc:instanceResponse a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain [ hpc:OpenAPIInstancesResponse ] ;
    rdfs:range [ hpc:Instance ] .

# Job response properties
hpc:jobResponse a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain [ hpc:OpenAPIJobsResponse ] ;
    rdfs:range [ hpc:Job ] .

# Response properties for both instances and jobs
hpc:content a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain [ hpc:OpenAPIResponse ] ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:schema a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain [ hpc:content ] ;
    rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .
```

This ontology fragment defines classes for OpenAPI responses, OpenAPI instances responses, and OpenAPI jobs responses. It also defines properties for the content and schema of the responses. The properties are declared as object properties, and their domains and ranges are specified. The content property has a range of xsd:string, and the schema property has a range of xsd:anyURI.
